    "cdb3be2a-9d5e-47f0-9431-04f739f3c7cc": {
      "type": "section-image-with-text",
      "disabled": true,
      "settings": {
        "section_height": "seven-fifty-height",
        "layout": "inline",
        "image_location": "left",
        "image_width": "standard",
        "subheading": "",
        "title": "<p>Our Story Began with Two Puppies Coming Home</p>",
        "heading_highlight_type": "circle",
        "highlight_color": "#d43747",
        "highlight_text_color": "#000000",
        "heading_size": 100,
        "content": "<p>At Koozi, we get that modern dog families need more than just functional pet accessories—they need solutions that blend seamlessly into their lives and homes. Our journey started with a personal challenge.<br/><br/>When I, Yelana, welcomed my mini dachshunds, Winston and Bailey, I quickly realised that the market was missing pet products that combined both function and style in a way that fit perfectly into a modern home, and specifically fit the needs of small to medium dogs.</p>",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "button_text": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_color": "btn--black",
        "button_style": "btn--solid",
        "button_size": "btn--small",
        "video_link": "",
        "text_color": "text-dark",
        "bg_color": "#f5f4f1",
        "gradient": "",
        "section_width": "wrapper",
        "padding_top": 60,
        "padding_bottom": 60
      }
    },
    "text": {
      "type": "section-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Each Koozi product is designed with purpose and style</p>",
            "size": 85,
            "heading_highlight_type": "italics",
            "highlight_color": "#d43747",
            "highlight_text_color": "#000000"
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Frustrated with the lack of options for dog parents who cherish their home interiors, we set out to create a better solution. We began with a crate that doubles as stylish side table furniture, followed by a linen dog bed designed for the unique needs of smaller dogs, and then our sofa topper range—simple, versatile, and waterproof protection for sofas.<br/></p><p><br/>Each Koozi product is created to solve real problems while providing comfort for style-driven dog parents and their beloved pups. Every piece is designed to enhance your space while serving a practical purpose.</p>",
            "size": 95
          }
        }
      },
